# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Never commit .env.local.
# Both values are safe to expose in the browser — the publishable key only
# grants what Row Level Security allows. The service role key is NOT used
# anywhere in this app; it lives only in the Edge Function's environment.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=sb_publishable_xxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# There is deliberately no SMS_API_KEY here, and there never should be.
#
# Vite compiles every VITE_ variable into the JavaScript bundle, so anything
# in this file is readable by anyone who opens the site and presses F12. That
# is fine for the two keys above and fatal for an SMS key, which spends the
# barangay's message allowance.
#
# The SMS key lives as an Edge Function secret instead:
#   supabase secrets set SMS_API_KEY=sk-... SMS_DISPATCH_SECRET=<random hex>
# See supabase/README.md.xx
